{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>יאונה</b> — from אנה לידו; its meaning is occasion and cause." "<b>ורשעים</b> — its meaning: even though they are full of evil thoughts, they cannot bring about any harm upon the righteous." "Another interpretation: <b>ורשעים מלאו רע</b> — an allusion to troubles that will be sated and full upon them."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:24.550636869Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}